      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file email_password_login.py, I need to write code that integrates with a concrete external provider for email and password authentication. The provider must be identifiable in the code, so I will use Firebase Authentication, which is a widely used service for this purpose. I will import the Firebase Admin SDK, which is specific to Firebase, and use it to authenticate users with email and password. </thinking>\n",
