      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create a Python script that registers a new user with an external provider, I need to choose a concrete external service. For this task, I will use Firebase Authentication, a widely used service for user authentication. The script will import the Firebase Admin SDK, which is the provider-specific integration code, and use it to create a new user. </thinking>\n",
